    "updated_at": "2025-02-08T05:22:24Z",
    "body": "Thanks for linking to chromium's implementation!\nFrom reading that, my suggestion is to:\n- Mostly revert #9241 to make \"showing auto/hint popover list\" a property of the document. (i.e. \"The Document has a showing auto popover list and a showing hint popover list, which are lists of HTML Elements, initially empty.\")\n- Add steps to \"show popover\" and \"hide popover\" to [append](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_element.cc;l=1582-1584;drc=9b045da738d6f6f5218604f66ad5c2c2ca6657a8) and [remove](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_element.cc;l=1906-1917;drc=9b045da738d6f6f5218604f66ad5c2c2ca6657a8) from the relevant list, respectively.\n- Reword the \"hide popover stack until\" and \"close entire popover list\" descriptions to explicitly state that the lists are given by reference (not sure how this should be worded). (Edit: Domenic says algorithm arguments are \"always assumed to be by reference\", so I guess this part is unnecessary)\n- Change step 2 in \"hide popover stack until\" to iterate in reverse.",
